cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: dataset
title: "VeriBench-Wild: A Benchmark and Measurement Testbed for Misinformation Evaluation"
abstract: >
  A benchmark and measurement testbed of 27,158 real-world social-media records
  from X Community Notes and UPFD, with frozen splits, a primary
  mechanism-typology task (T1), supporting and diagnostic task views, public and
  full representations, and reference baselines.
